   "notes": "The ThetaData daily chain through the onboarding read seam, newest member first, deduplicated by UNIT (symbol, date) only, latest acquired wins (see the census document), restricted at intake to the sample roots and projected to the ten fields the features read. A pull lands one root at a time, so rows arrive grouped by root with dates newest first, which is what symbol_contiguous reads. Lazy. Read-only. DEVELOPMENT DATES ONLY: keep_values names every weekday of 2016-01-04..2020-12-31 (holidays carry no rows), so no validation-year (2021-2025) row reaches a node; the reader still parses those rows before dropping them (ADR-0265 Amendment 4)."
  },
  "features": {
   "uses": "dskit.pipeline.libs.chain_features:ChainDayFeatures",
   "inputs": {
    "records": "$chain.records",
    "rates": "$rates.records"
   },
   "params": {
    "symbol_field": "symbol",
    "date_field": "date",
    "expiration_field": "expiration",
    "strike_field": "strike",
    "right_field": "right",
    "bid_field": "bid",
    "ask_field": "ask",
    "underlying_price_field": "underlying_price",
    "call_values": [
     "call"
    ],
    "put_values": [
     "put"
    ],
    "end_before": "2021-01-01",
    "targets": [
     {
      "dte": 30,
      "tolerance": 7
     },
     {
      "dte": 90,
      "tolerance": 14
     }
    ],
    "target_field": "target_dte",
    "atm_band": 0.05,
    "wing_delta": 0.25,
    "min_forward_pairs": 5,
    "fields": {
     "expiration": "expiration",
     "dte": "dte",
     "spot": "spot",
     "atm_iv": "atm_iv",
     "straddle_ratio": "straddle_ratio"
    },
    "status_field": "status",
    "symbol_contiguous": true,
    "rate_date_field": "observation_date",
    "rate_value_field": "DGS3MO",
    "rate_max_age_days": 5,
    "rate_scale": 0.01
   },
   "notes": "Only what the event detector reads: the 30- and 90-day targets (the nearest listed expiry within 7 and 14 days), the ATM implied vol (Black-76 on the parity forward from NBBO mids, T-bill rate as in run-theta-chain-features.json), the ATM straddle over spot and the day's underlying price. Open interest and volume are not read."
  },
  "events": {
   "uses": "dskit.pipeline.libs.chain_events:ChainEventDetector",
   "inputs": {
    "records": "$features.records"
   },
   "params": {
    "symbol_field": "symbol",
    "date_field": "date",
    "target_field": "target_dte",
    "iv_field": "atm_iv",
    "straddle_field": "straddle_ratio",
    "spot_field": "spot",
    "status_field": "status",
    "status_ok": "ok",
    "front_target": 30,
    "back_target": 90,
    "end_before": "2021-01-01",
    "window": 60,
    "min_history": 20,
    "crush_min": 0.12,
    "crush_z_min": 3.0,
    "spread_drop_min": 0.01,
    "refractory": 50,
    "max_market_share": 0.4,
    "min_symbols_for_guard": 10,
    "max_gap_days": 5,
    "entry_lead": 3,
    "exit_lag": 1,
    "scale_floor": 0.01
   },
   "notes": "Front = the 30-day target, back = the 90-day target. EVERY rule value is a param of the node (none is a default in dskit): the frozen values, chosen on AAPL 2016-2019 announcement dates only (ADR-0265 Amendment 4): window 60, min_history 20, crush_min 0.12 (log), crush_z_min 3 robust sigmas, spread_drop_min 0.01 vol points, refractory 50 sessions, max_market_share 0.4 once at least 10 symbols reach the rules, max_gap_days 5, entry_lead 3, exit_lag 1. The realized move is an output, never a criterion. With one symbol the cross-sectional guard is OFF. end_before 2021-01-01: development years only; the validation years are run once, by the pre-registered validation run."
  },
  "labels": {
   "uses": "table-file",
   "params": {
    "path": "configs/theta-earnings-labels-2016-2020.json",
    "source": "Announcement dates of quarterly results for AAPL, MSFT, AMZN, GOOGL and NVDA, 2016-01-01..2020-12-31, recalled by the implementer from the public releases and not cross-checked in this repository; each carries a confidence",
    "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
    "sha256": "16668d5d6eafbb3b1fc10742fefef18123d2df865d79e794c27f52f925b5f92f",
    "expect": 2
   },
   "notes": "The owner-supplied labelled dates. Only confidence 'high' labels are scored (AAPL); 'medium' labels are for the other symbols once their features exist. Nothing after 2020-12-31."
  },
  "calibrate": {
   "uses": "dskit.pipeline.libs.chain_events:ChainEventCalibrator",
   "inputs": {
    "records": "$features.records",
    "labels": "$labels.table"
